  "id": "rpi-export-mixed-units-xlsx",
  "title": "Army real property inventory (GFEBS) export workbook with mixed units of measure (89 records: SF buildings, SY parking/roads, AC grounds, LF/EA/KW/GA/MB structures) plus a one-page scope memo PDF",
  "theme": "military-bos",
  "provenance": {
    "fidelity": "real-format",
    "sources": [
      {
        "url": "https://www.esd.whs.mil/Portals/54/Documents/DD/forms/dd/dd1354.pdf",
        "note": "DD Form 1354: facility number, CATCODE, primary unit of measure and quantity (plus secondary UM) as the per-facility real property record fields; basis for the FACILITY_NUMBER / CATCODE / PRIMARY_UM / TOTAL_UM_QTY columns."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://www.esd.whs.mil/Portals/54/Documents/DD/issuances/dodi/416514p.pdf",
        "note": "DoDI 4165.14 Real Property Inventory and Reporting: facility number and RPA total unit-of-measure quantity/code among validated asset fields; cited as reference a in the memo."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://bea.osd.mil/bea11.2/reports/definitions1_businessrule_172534.htm",
        "note": "DoD BEA business rule: when the real property type is land, the total unit of measure code must be \"AC\" (acres) – grounds rows use UM AC."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://www.usace.army.mil/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=bdnXSYCqMYI%3D&portalid=2",
        "note": "USACE Army facilities unit-cost table: CATCODE 85210 organizational vehicle parking measured in SY; 72111 UEPH and 72210 dining facility titles; 851XX/852XX roads, parking and sidewalk pavement series."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://armypubs.army.mil/epubs/DR_pubs/DR_a/pdf/web/r415_28.pdf",
        "note": "AR 415-28 Real Property Category Codes (CATCD system; DA Pam 415-28 guide cited as reference b in the memo)."
      },
      {
        "url": "https://www.ngbpmc.ng.mil/Portals/27/Publications/NGPAM/ngpam%20210-20.pdf?ver=oRUMEnfm1FpHJToG0Kuskg%3D%3D",
        "note": "NG Pam 210-20: RPLANS compares real property assets identified in the RPI with calculated requirements (RPI extract as a planning data source)."
      }
    ],
    "notes": "Column set and unit-of-measure codes follow DoD real property record fields (DD 1354 / DoDI 4165.14) and Army CATCODE conventions; the memo format follows Army office memoranda. The installation (Fort Tolland), solicitation number, every facility number, name, RPUID, CATCODE assignment (other than the confirmed 72111/72210/85210 titles), quantity, floor count and status are illustrative."
  },
