  "traps": [
    "Single worksheet with 89 records of mixed units in one TOTAL_UM_QTY column (displayed with format #,##0.00): only PRIMARY_UM = SF rows with FAC_STATUS ACTIVE are facilities (48).",
    "5 SF building rows are excluded by status: 00130 OLD POST HEADQUARTERS (VACANT) (CLOSED); 00132 BOWLING CENTER (DISPOSED); 02207 GENERAL PURPOSE WAREHOUSE (CLOSED); 1115 UEPH BARRACKS (ROLLING PIN) (DISPOSED); T0230 MODULAR ADMIN BUILDING (DISPOSED).",
    "Parking rows (CATCODE 85210 organizational hardstands and 85215 POV lots) are in SY and go to grounds parking in sqyd: 8 active rows totalling 98,810 SY (= 889,290 SF). PK130 (CLOSED) is excluded. Parking rows whose name cites \"BLDG 0xxxx\" carry that building number.",
    "Roads (85110/85120, 5 rows, 126,050 SY) and the vehicle wash platform (21470, 2,950 SY) are also SY but out of scope per memo para 3: neither parking nor facilities.",
    "Improved grounds (93210, AC) → improved_turf and semi-improved grounds (93220, AC) → semi_improved are in scope; GR004 (DISPOSED, 11.2 AC) is excluded.",
    "Unimproved grounds and training lands (93230: GR020 8,640 AC, GR021 1,215.75 AC) are listed in AC but are out of scope per the memo (Range Control / ITAM); a reader that adds every AC row would overstate grounds by 9,855.75 acres.",
    "Fences in LF, utilities in EA / KW / LF / GA / MB (substation 7,500 KW, 500,000 GA water tank, 58,200 LF water mains, 142 EA hydrants) are excluded; their large quantities must not become square footage or grounds.",
    "Scope rules live only in the separate one-page cover memo PDF; the workbook itself has no scope column.",
    "FACILITY_NUMBER mixes text cells with leading zeros (\"00101\", \"02201\", \"T0230\") and numeric cells that lost their zeros (1101..1125); the memo says 1101 is facility 01101. Truth uses the exported value (\"1101\").",
    "RPUID (first column) is a 7-digit record key, not a quantity; CATCODE is a 5-digit numeric cell and must not be read as square feet.",
    "Twin rows 1101/1103/1105 UEPH BARRACKS (58,750 SF each) and two \"GENERAL PURPOSE WAREHOUSE\" rows (02205 ACTIVE, 02207 CLOSED) share names; facility number decides.",
    "02221 COVERED STORAGE SHED (POLE BARN) has a blank FLOORS cell (truth omits floors); 02219 FUEL POINT CONTROL BUILDING is only 640 SF but is a building in scope.",
    "Last row is a report trailer \"*** END OF REPORT - 89 RECORDS ***\", not a record.",
    "Category is asserted only where the CATCODE title is unambiguous (UEPH/UOPH → barracks, DINING FACILITY → dining, ADMIN GEN PURPOSE / HQ / COF → admin, HANGAR → hangar, WAREHOUSE/STORAGE → warehouse, MAINT SHOP → maintenance, CLINIC → medical, PFC → fitness, CDC → child_care, INSTRUCTION/SIMULATION → education, chapel/library/ACS/post office/community center → community)."
  ]
}
